Description: Socii: the allied sources of Armatos
 Outside APT repositories that keep Armatos's laws:
  - Mozilla's, so Firefox comes as a real .deb built and supported by
    Mozilla, never Ubuntu's snap shim;
  - Proton's, for the Proton VPN app (it replaces Proton's own
    protonvpn-stable-release package, which sets up the same source).
 Both appear in Forum.
